        "cultivation": {
          "realm": "qi_gathering",
          "stage": "4: Second pair"
        },
        "text": "At the far gate, Bao Jun measured the timber with a carpenter's square. He was thirty-one, broad in the shoulders and careful about where he rested his thumb. A saw accident had taught him to support a board before arguing over its cut. He showed Yue a hollow beneath the lower seal, then let her find the corresponding wear mark herself. The water escaped along a material gap. Neither the old loan nor the new auction notice had caused that particular leak.",
