        "text": "The first defect was a child's wooden whistle caught beneath a floating gate shoe. Its owner watched from the bank, pale with the fear of being blamed for the stalled grain boat. Luo closed the upstream hand gate and showed Yue where the ordinary flow indicator settled. Only then did she use a hooked pole to lift the whistle free. The lock moved again. Yue gave it back with its split mouthpiece visible, refusing the child's first insistence that a beast had swallowed it.",
