        "actor": "lin_yue",
        "text": "On the far bank, small roadside shrines held offerings of split sticks rather than flowers. Shi Lan said travelers left dry kindling for the next person who needed the shelter hearth. The kindling was useful only while someone kept its roof whole. A shrine near the turn had lost three tiles; rain had swollen the little woodpile beneath it. Yue marked the damaged shelter on her personal route sketch and left the wet sticks where they were.",
