        "text": "The ticket named Luo Jian as a shore loader, though Fen's father sometimes used Jian Luo when merchants copied his name into foreign order. A narrow line beneath the amount said wages payable on verified return or to a named recipient. The recipient space was blank. Yue read the line twice, then asked Fen who had retained the voyage contract. Fen said her father had carried his copy. The ticket could support a search for that contract. It could not make Fen the recipient by itself.",
