        "cultivation": {
          "realm": "qi_gathering",
          "stage": "4: Second pair"
        },
        "text": "A work bell hung from a timber beam at the hall's far end. Its rope was new above a knot and old below it. Luo pulled once, then asked Yue what the sound had told her. \"That this bell can be heard here,\" she answered. \"I do not know whether a worker beside the running fan would hear it.\" He pointed to the fan's unpowered housing. Tomorrow's check would include that location. A cold demonstration could establish a beginning without quietly claiming the test it had not performed.",
